    {
      "text": "Fig. 13, 'Workflow I: report generation business process'. Two lanes: vaccination location health worker, and PCPOSS. From Start the health worker does 1. define parameters for report; the PCPOSS does 2. generate report; the health worker does 3. high level review and decides 4. report acceptable? No loops back to step 1; yes leads to 5. analyse, and the process ends.",
